## Story draft

I wanted exercise to feel less like counting seconds and more like playing for one more try. Flap
Fit is a camera-controlled fitness game: choose a workout, calibrate two positions, and move your
body to guide your bird through obstacles. The bird you fly is also the bird you grow. Training
time unlocks ten increasingly muscular evolution stages, making progress visible inside the game.

The launch workouts are push-ups, squats, pull-ups, bicep curls, lateral raises, and shoulder
press. Players can use the illustrated Sky background or place the bird and obstacles over their
live camera view. Record & Play captures a temporary clip on the phone for the player to share
through the device's normal share sheet. Optional Compete features include scoreboards and
friend-code challenges without an email-and-password signup.

Camera pose estimation runs on the device. The game does not upload workout video, and normal Play
does not record it. Training-time and movement estimates are game feedback, not medical
measurements or perfect-form certification.

Flap Fit is free to play. [FINAL BUILD ONLY: Once verified, describe how AdMob interstitials are
