## Best Game category draft

The core loop ties a player's physical effort to a readable arcade challenge: calibrate, fly,
avoid obstacles, finish a run, and return with a stronger bird. Six stylized exercise birds make
workout selection distinct; the evolving bird gives long-term progress a visible character. Sky
and Live Camera offer two visual treatments without changing the movement rules. The planned
monetization keeps the exercise itself uninterrupted, with an optional interstitial opportunity
only after a deliberate result-screen exit. Verify that behavior in the published build before
using this paragraph.

## Catvertising category draft

[USE ONLY AFTER REAL REVENUECAT ADS INTEGRATION IS VERIFIED] Flap Fit's ad break is placed after
